{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mergeChanges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}]}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only."}]}],"name":"policy"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is what a remote-change observer should call. Where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" re-reads every row of every registered entity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on every tick, this reads the store’s transaction log since the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"merge and spends the result through "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/mergeRemote(into:ids:deleted:policy:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— so a tick on an N-row table where k rows changed costs O(k). A tick with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no transactions behind it costs one history fetch and nothing else."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every guarantee the other two make holds here. Deletions come from history"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"tombstones, which are positive evidence, so unlike a full re-hydration this"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"can"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" remove the last surviving row. Pending local writes and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holds still win, and that is not configurable.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"When it re-reads everything instead","anchor":"When-it-re-reads-everything-instead","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The narrow path is an optimisation, never a weakening: anything that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves a window unaccounted for falls back to the full read, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fallback keeps its empty-snapshot guard. It happens on the first tick","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after launch or a container rebuild, when the watermark has expired or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"history fetch fails, when a deletion’s tombstone carries no identity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(every row deleted before ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Attribute(.preserveValueOnDeletion)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shipped),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when a changed row can’t be resolved, and when more than one store sits","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behind the container.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The watermark advances whenever a tick read every registered entity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"successfully — including a tick that declined to apply some of what it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read. A row an editing hold defers is carried forward by identity and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-offered next tick, which is what keeps a hold from quietly becoming a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"veto without costing a full table read per tick to prevent. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:HowToAddICloudSync"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both outcomes are reported: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/remoteChangesMerged","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a narrowed tick, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/historyUnavailable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a reason for a fallback. A narrowed tick counts what it re-offered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separately from what it merged, so a hold that is never released — which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes every tick re-offer the same rows forever — reads as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/carriedOverCount","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" equal to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/mergedCount","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", rather than as healthy traffic."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/mergeChanges(into:policy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/mergechanges(into:policy:)"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Merges only the rows persistent history says changed, falling back to a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"full ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" whenever history can’t answer.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"mergeChanges(into:policy:)","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE12mergeChanges4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mergeChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}]},"references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/EntityDB":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EntityDB","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/entitydb","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A generic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@ModelActor"},{"type":"text","text":" that reads and writes any "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistableModel","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityDB","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityDB","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"EntityDB"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceDiagnostic/carriedOverCount":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/mergedCount","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" were rows an earlier tick deferred and this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one re-offered, rather than news the window brought."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Set only for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/remoteChangesMerged","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"carriedOverCount","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"carriedOverCount","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencediagnostic\/carriedovercount","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/carriedOverCount"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceCoordinator/editing":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","title":"editing","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Entities the app has declared it is editing, exempt from the merge until","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"released.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/editing","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"editing","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence12EditingHoldsC"}]},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence","title":"SwiduxPersistence","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[]},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceDiagnostic/Kind-swift.struct/historyUnavailable":{"type":"topic","title":"historyUnavailable","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/p